"Guess the Zone: Nagas, ghosts, and satyrs are some of the local inhabitants in this zone. The zone was named after the former kaldorei Queen, which is now the leader of the naga's.\nAzshara\n\nFelwood\tRedridge Mountains\tTanaris",
"Guess the Zone: This zone features the Hydraxian Waterlords faction. The zone is also known to be one of best-looking zones in World of Warcraft.\nAzshara\n\nDesolace\tFelwood\tRedridge Mountains",
